<title>USA: GST names Joseph Basile president, COO.</title>
<headline>GST names Joseph Basile president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER, Wash. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>GST Telecommunications Inc Monday named Joseph Basile Jr to the post of president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Previously, Basile was chief operating officer for Cable and Wireless Plc's Cable and Wireless Inc.  </p>
<p>The company said Chief Executive John Warta was previously acting president.</p>
